        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "When we talk about table tennis, China may be the first country that "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "comes to your mind",
            "ref": "v-come-to-ones-mind"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Chinese players often come first in table tennis matches. But do you know how this beautiful game was "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b1",
            "number": 1
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " created?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "In the 1870s, people in England loved to play "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "lawn tennis",
            "zh": "草地网球"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". But in winter, the weather was too cold. People wanted to enjoy the sport "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b2",
            "number": 2
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Then they started a new kind of tennis. They would play it on their "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b3",
            "number": 3
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The sport "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "developed",
            "ref": "v-develop"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " over the years. "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "Thanks to",
            "ref": "v-thanks-to"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " an Englishman, Ivor Montagu, China learnt about table tennis in the 1950s. Chinese people quickly "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b4",
            "number": 4
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the game. They played it in schools, factories, gyms and "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "almost",
            "ref": "v-almost"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b5",
            "number": 5
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "In 1959, China won the "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "World Championship",
            "zh": "世界锦标赛"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " for the first time. In 1988, table tennis became an "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Olympic",
            "zh": "奥运会的"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " "
          },
          {
